### List of Changes in [LabReportGrouping.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/patienthub/model/LabReportGrouping.kt)

1. **Expanded `CBC_KEYWORDS`**:
   - Added British spellings and catalog tokens: `"haemoglobin"`, `"hemoglobin"`, `"hb"`, `"haematocrit"`, `"hematocrit"`, `"hct"`, `"mcv"`, `"mch"`, `"mchc"`, `"white cell"`, `"white blood"`, `"wbc"`, `"platelet"`, `"plt"`, `"rbc"`, `"red blood"`.

2. **Whole-Token Matching for `"hb"`, `"plt"`, `"alt"`, and `"ast"`**:
   - Added `WHOLE_TOKEN_KEYWORDS = setOf("hb", "plt", "alt", "ast")`.
   - Extracted words/tokens by splitting lowercase test name on non-letters (`nameLower.split(Regex("[^a-z]+")).filter { it.isNotEmpty() }.toSet()`).
   - Implemented `matchesKeyword` helper: checks set membership for token keywords (`"hb"`, `"plt"`, `"alt"`, `"ast"`) and substring containment for all other keywords.
   - Prevents `"Fasting Blood Sugar (FBS)"` from matching LFT keyword `"ast"`.

3. **Reordered Composite Grouping Evaluation & Hardened Urine Checks**:
   - Reordered `when` branches so **Urine** and **Stool** are evaluated **before** CBC.
   - Updated the Urine condition to:
     ```kotlin
     catLower == "urinalysis" || catLower.contains("urine") || catLower.contains("urinalysis") || nameLower.contains("urine") || URINE_KEYWORDS.any { nameLower.contains(it) }
     ```
   - Ensures `"RBCs (Urine)"` (category `"Urinalysis"`) is always classified as Urine and never intercepted by CBC.

4. **Signatures and Files**:
   - Kept all function names and signatures intact (`partitionReportIntoCompositeGroups`, `groupLabsIntoReports`).
   - Edited only `LabReportGrouping.kt`, created no new files, and ran no git or gradle commands.
